   "description": "JIP LN NVSE runtime-query probes, set jip-getters: numbers, strings, mod and version queries (docs/spec-notes/jip-math-utility.md); keyed by probe id. Oracle: the original game with JIP 57.30, each step compiled and run inside the game by nvf_capture (tools/capture/jip_probes.py with capture_run.py; private golden). Candidate: fnvtool ext queries, the same steps (tools/capture/jip-probes/<job>.steps.json) as headless runner queries. The load order is the one the game ran with: FalloutNV.esm, the nine DLC masters and NVFExtProbe.esp (GetNthModName 0-10 in the owner's game, 2026-10-26).",
   "oracle": {"golden": "jip/jip-getters.json"},
   "candidate": {
    "argv": ["{candidate}", "ext", "queries", "{data_dir}", "FalloutNV.esm", "DeadMoney.esm", "HonestHearts.esm", "OldWorldBlues.esm", "LonesomeRoad.esm",
